{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026C6F7M3Exwv1795677542.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>電訊商數碼通表示，部分地區網絡服務不穩定，正積極調查及跟進。</p><p></p><p>多名市民下午約2時，在社交平台發文指，數碼通的網絡訊號中斷，手機顯示網絡沒有服務，無法使用流動數據上網及通話，亦有人稱家中的寬頻同樣受影響。</p><p></p><p>數碼通在社交平台發通知，指留意到部分地區的網絡服務出現不穩定情況，正積極調查及跟進，會盡力減低對客戶影響。如有進一步消息會適時公布，就造成不便致歉。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T08:03:05.357693+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":176,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T07:09:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T07:56:29.241325+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T07:56:29.241325+00:00","content_hash":"05219aba62684a3f31d90c11a2482d5321f1ad0740c5d759bdf08f1eb5ddae8c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}